flowchart TD
    A([Start])
    --> B[Administrator opens User Group]
    --> C[Select Role]
    --> D[Calculate affected population]
    --> E[Show impact]
    --> F{High impact?}

    F -- Yes --> G[Require confirmation]
    --> H{Confirmed?}
    H -- No --> I([Cancel])
    H -- Yes --> J[Assign Role]

    F -- No --> J

    J --> K[Mark configuration pending synchronization]
    --> L[Record audit]
    --> M([Completed])
